WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.327
- Here he comes, here he comes.

00:00:01.327 --> 00:00:02.425
- San Diego, baby!

00:00:02.425 --> 00:00:03.440
- You remember my friend, Steven?

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:04.207
- What's up?

00:00:04.207 --> 00:00:05.669
- Yeah dude, we're gonna
record all these memories

00:00:05.669 --> 00:00:07.499
and watch them everyday. Yeah!

00:00:07.499 --> 00:00:08.392
("Breaking All the Rules" by Warner)

00:00:08.392 --> 00:00:11.410
[Zack] Yo, we got the beach,
Sea World, California burritos

00:00:11.410 --> 00:00:12.896
- [Justin] The best weekend.

00:00:12.896 --> 00:00:16.542
- [Zack] With my best friend.
Man, Airbnb really came through.

00:00:16.542 --> 00:00:18.259
- It's gonna be a dope weekend.

00:00:18.259 --> 00:00:19.514
Woah.

00:00:19.514 --> 00:00:20.489
- This place is perfect.

00:00:20.489 --> 00:00:21.162
- It's huge.

00:00:21.162 --> 00:00:22.602
- Home sweet home, baby.

00:00:22.602 --> 00:00:23.508
Man, check this out.

00:00:23.508 --> 00:00:24.251
- [Zack] Yo, what we got?

00:00:24.251 --> 00:00:24.970
- [Justin] 30 stocked.

00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:25.853
- [Zack] Yo, to the best weekend.

00:00:26.239 --> 00:00:28.468
- I can't get over how nice this place is.

00:00:28.468 --> 00:00:30.977
- I know right, like what?
(ping pong ball taps on ground)

00:00:30.977 --> 00:00:32.193
(spooky noise)

00:00:32.193 --> 00:00:34.511
Hey check this out. The TV's
just playing Mario cart.

00:00:34.609 --> 00:00:35.607
- So?

00:00:35.607 --> 00:00:38.010
- It's not connected to
a console, I checked.

00:00:38.010 --> 00:00:40.086
- I mean, it's probably
Bluetooth or whatever, you know?

00:00:40.086 --> 00:00:41.022
- This is weird, right?

00:00:41.022 --> 00:00:42.750
(spooky static noise)

00:00:43.050 --> 00:00:44.748
Yo Steve, are you hearing that?

00:00:44.748 --> 00:00:46.863
(men chanting)

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:52.732
What? Hello?

00:00:52.732 --> 00:00:54.537
I'm telling you, there's some weird stuff

00:00:54.537 --> 00:00:55.811
that's going on right now.

00:00:55.811 --> 00:00:57.106
- [Justin] Zack, did you set this up?

00:00:57.106 --> 00:00:58.188
- No, was this you Steve?

00:00:58.188 --> 00:00:58.788
- [Steven] No.

00:00:58.788 --> 00:00:59.767
- [Justin] Who set this up?

00:00:59.767 --> 00:01:01.857
Whatever man, let's just
have a great San Diego.

00:01:01.857 --> 00:01:05.084
Yo Steven, get over here,
Zack and I are on fire.

00:01:05.084 --> 00:01:07.244
(man laughs) Are you kidding me?

00:01:07.244 --> 00:01:09.194
We're hitting a world record.

00:01:09.194 --> 00:01:10.680
- You're getting
everything on this, right?

00:01:10.680 --> 00:01:12.744
- [Creepy Voiceover] No bounces.

00:01:13.594 --> 00:01:15.732
- That just exploded, what was that?

00:01:15.732 --> 00:01:17.040
- Did you hear that?

00:01:17.040 --> 00:01:19.039
It says this house used
to be a frat house.

00:01:19.039 --> 00:01:19.782
- [Steven] What happened?

00:01:19.782 --> 00:01:22.543
- It got shut down for partying too hard.

00:01:22.543 --> 00:01:25.703
- Get a late night snack. Oh, what's this?

00:01:25.973 --> 00:01:28.813
Alright Zack, good one. You got me.

00:01:30.763 --> 00:01:32.100
- What are you doing?

00:01:32.100 --> 00:01:34.340
- (croaking) Your turn.

00:01:34.340 --> 00:01:35.825
- I'm good.

00:01:35.825 --> 00:01:38.153
- [Zack] Yo, you excited
to hike La Jolla tomorrow?

00:01:38.523 --> 00:01:40.795
- Sounds like a sausage fest, dude.

00:01:40.795 --> 00:01:41.724
- [Zack] What?

00:01:41.724 --> 00:01:43.094
- I'm not going unless there are chicks.

00:01:43.094 --> 00:01:45.857
- I'm telling you,
Justin's been acting weird.

00:01:45.857 --> 00:01:47.436
I'm gonna set up this camera,

00:01:47.436 --> 00:01:48.747
see if he does anything weird tonight.

00:01:48.747 --> 00:01:50.476
(metal scratch tune)

00:01:54.956 --> 00:01:56.273
Yo, get the camera.

00:01:56.273 --> 00:01:58.590
Yo, what is that? What is that?

00:02:00.560 --> 00:02:02.305
Hey, what were you doing last night?

00:02:02.305 --> 00:02:05.298
- I don't know what
you're talking about, bro.

00:02:05.298 --> 00:02:07.969
- No, you do, I saw you on camera.

00:02:07.969 --> 00:02:09.757
- You filming me, pledge?

00:02:11.047 --> 00:02:14.264
Zackie! You taking a monster deuce, bro?

00:02:14.264 --> 00:02:15.696
- I have no other choice.

00:02:16.096 --> 00:02:17.253
- Take me to him.

00:02:17.253 --> 00:02:18.598
Listen, Justin's my best friend.

00:02:18.598 --> 00:02:20.107
- Okay, well he's my best friend.

00:02:20.107 --> 00:02:22.082
- He's my best friend, but before that,

00:02:22.082 --> 00:02:25.703
I was a bro. (male choir singing)

00:02:25.703 --> 00:02:28.002
He was the one that helped
me stop being a bro.

00:02:28.002 --> 00:02:29.786
Now it's time to help him.

00:02:29.786 --> 00:02:30.989
(sudden spooky music)

00:02:30.989 --> 00:02:33.245
Hey, what's up bro? I got the new GTA 5

00:02:33.245 --> 00:02:36.794
and some Family Guy DVR'd if
you just wanna kick it, fam.

00:02:36.794 --> 00:02:38.324
You need to break the bro code.

00:02:38.324 --> 00:02:41.618
If we break the bro code,
the demons will come out.

00:02:42.018 --> 00:02:43.086
- Give me a music festival.

00:02:43.086 --> 00:02:44.271
- Coachella, I don't know.

00:02:44.271 --> 00:02:46.639
- You've got no money to
go to Coachella this year.

00:02:46.639 --> 00:02:47.730
(grunting noise)

00:02:47.730 --> 00:02:49.588
You're not crushing it, bro.

00:02:49.588 --> 00:02:50.586
(growling noise)

00:02:50.586 --> 00:02:51.515
- It's not working!

00:02:51.515 --> 00:02:54.285
- DDM an actor of the bro
(Justin screaming and laughing)

00:02:54.285 --> 00:02:55.880
You need to chill.

00:02:55.880 --> 00:02:57.964
(Justin yells demonically)

00:02:57.964 --> 00:02:59.716
He's too powerful.

00:02:59.716 --> 00:03:01.499
I don't know if you know,
but I studied in Europe.

00:03:01.499 --> 00:03:03.844
And the word they used
for bro is fraterna,

00:03:03.844 --> 00:03:05.667
it's their number one bro.

00:03:05.667 --> 00:03:09.138
You're his number one bro
now. Only you can save him.

00:03:09.138 --> 00:03:11.110
- That's not my bro in there.

00:03:11.440 --> 00:03:13.434
- [Guy in Hat] A bro
never leaves a bro behind.

00:03:13.434 --> 00:03:17.195
(static noises)

00:03:23.815 --> 00:03:25.636
(door squeaks)

00:03:25.636 --> 00:03:28.119
(clapping)

00:03:28.119 --> 00:03:29.983
(Zack yells)

00:03:31.653 --> 00:03:35.560
("Breaking All the Rules" by Warner)

00:03:38.800 --> 00:03:41.401
(light piano)

00:03:41.401 --> 00:03:43.049
- It's just so sad what's
happening over there.

00:03:43.049 --> 00:03:44.561
- Oh, yeah.

00:03:44.561 --> 00:03:47.507
(snare drum)

00:03:47.507 --> 00:03:49.178
You don't know the half of it.

00:03:49.178 --> 00:03:51.233
(light piano)

